## Technical Advantage

- **Advanced Topology Implementation** — Qmax Systems implements Resonant LLC converters, Phase-Shifted Full Bridge (PSFB), and multi-phase interleaved topologies for optimized efficiency.
- **Wide-Bandgap Integration** — Qmax Systems designs with Silicon Carbide (SiC) and Gallium Nitride (GaN) FETs to achieve higher switching frequencies and power densities.
- **Thermal & Fluid Dynamics** — Qmax Systems designs advanced cooling, including liquid-cooled cold plates and optimized forced-air heat-sink geometries.
- **Magnetics Design** — Qmax Systems designs custom inductors and transformers, minimizing core loss and controlling leakage inductance.

